\item \points{7c}

Imagine you are in a setting where you have a separate verifier system that can validate hypotheses (e.g., a human in the loop that inspects the hypotheses). 
You want to capture as much true information as possible in this setting. Which system would you choose and why? 

\textbf{What we expect:} 2-3 sentences explaining your choice, tying in the definitions of soundness and completeness. 

